cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please also credit pyTENAX, from which the SMEV
  estimator in smev.py is derived (see THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md).
title: >-
  Areal SMEV: SMEV applied to areal precipitation over space and its temperature scaling
abstract: >-
  Script for fitting the Simplified Metastatistical Extreme Value (SMEV)
  model to areal precipitation in convection-permitting and regional
  climate model output. It computes precipitation return levels at various spatial and temporal scales, 
  characterizes the spatial structure of the underlying precipitation ordinary events, and estimates their 
  temperature scaling by quantile regression.
type: software
